snp3.9:65.1 starts: The wise see action in this way
snp3.9:65.2 starts: as it has come to be,
snp3.9:65.3 starts: seeing dependent co-arising,
snp3.9:65.4 starts: cognizant of action’s results.
snp3.8:19.1 starts: Seeking your own happiness,
snp3.8:19.2 starts: you should pull out your own arrow:
snp3.8:19.3 starts: your own
snp3.8:19.4 starts: longing,
snp3.9:10.1 starts: As people going
snp3.9:10.2 starts: pay homage, venerating
snp3.9:10.3 starts: the moon when it’s just past new,
snp3.9:10.4 starts: in the same way in the world, Gotama,
snp3.9:23.1 starts: In human beings that’s not found
snp3.9:23.2 starts: individually in their bodies,
snp3.9:23.3 starts: but their identification is described
snp3.9:23.4 starts: in terms of convention:
snp3.9:32.1 starts: I don’t call one a brahman
snp3.9:32.2 starts: for being born of a mother
snp3.9:32.3 starts: He’s called a ‘bho-sayer’
snp3.9:32.4 starts: if he has anything at all.
snp3.9:32.5 starts: But someone with nothing,
snp3.9:32.6 starts: He’s what I call
snp3.9:35.1 starts: He endures—unangered—
snp3.9:35.2 starts: insult, assault, & imprisonment.
snp3.9:35.3 starts: His army is strength;
snp3.9:35.4 starts: He’s what I call
snp3.9:45.1 starts: Here in the world
snp3.9:45.2 starts: —long, short,
snp3.9:45.3 starts: attractive, not:
snp3.9:45.4 starts: He’s what I call
snp3.9:56.1 starts: He whose course they don’t know
snp3.9:56.2 starts: —devas, gandhabbas, & human beings—
snp3.9:56.3 starts: his effluents ended, an arahant:
snp3.9:56.4 starts: He’s what I call
snp3.9:60.1 starts: For this is a convention in the world:
snp3.9:60.2 starts: the name & clan determined,
snp3.9:60.3 starts: come into being from common consent,
snp3.9:60.4 starts: here & there determined.
snp3.9:61.1 starts: Taking a position unknowingly
snp3.9:61.2 starts: for a long time obsessively,
snp3.9:61.3 starts: those who don’t know
snp3.9:61.4 starts: that one is a brahman by birth.
